{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子がぁぁぁ～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来るぅぅぅ～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！29回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n電子ぬんちゃくさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたの冒頭あいさつもお待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画質の悪さがポイントだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のメール見た方はわかると思うんですが\n昨日は書くか書かないか迷って\nうじうじしているうちに\n時間がなくなってちゃんとしたのを書けませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、昨日のブログに\n更新ありがとうって無理しないでって\n皆さんの優しい言葉に\nこれからも続けていこう！って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、私自身こうやって\nブログ更新をして自分のことを発信していくことは大事だなって思ってやってたし\n皆さんにもっともっと知ってもらいたいって\n思ってやってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その気持ちは変わらないから続けます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の初雪の日は\nお父さんとお母さんの\n結婚記念日24周年でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結婚記念日だからといって\n特別に2人で旅行に行ったり\nお買い物に行ったり\nそんなことはないけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう特別なことをしなくても\nいつまでも仲良しな両親が\n私はだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は平日だったし\n私もお仕事があったから\nどこか連れて行ってあげること\nできなかったけど、\nいつか両親の結婚記念日の日に\n両親とお兄ちゃんと妹と\nチップとしろみときみも連れて\n旅行に行けたらいいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉旅行٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりとひなこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相楽と北野"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ぱうさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ハムスターだよね？\n思ったより大きいね。\nそれとも、写真の撮り方で大きく見えるだけかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ハムちゃんだよー！写真の撮り方でかな！\nあと寝るときの体制で体がベチャってひらべったくなってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆mizu-mizuさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは動物園と水族館のどっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎どちらかというと動物園！でも動物園2回行ったら1回水族館挟みたいかんじ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旭山動物園がいちばんすき！\n動物園も水族館も楽しめるし\nすごくワクワクして楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆てつぺろんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きんちゃんは髪型ロングにしたいって思わないの～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎思います！でもボブもすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよう！伸ばすか切るか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆こせきんぐさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんが読んでいつも笑ってしまうようなブログを書くメンバーは誰ですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎あやねちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真面目かっ！！！っとツッコミながら読んでます！だいすき！あやねちゃんのそゆところ！\n独特の雰囲気！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆アシタカさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁給食のメニューで何が1番好きだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎あげぱんとか！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サラダ部門ではダントツで元気の出るサラダ！\n元気の出るサラダっていう名前のサラダ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひろおり。さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁僕から一番近い星って何ですか？教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎サンクエトワールという五つ星です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひろっぴさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁朝起きて1番初めにやる事は何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎チップのとこへいきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆りょーへーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今日席替えしたんだ！一番前‼(T-T)\n【きんちゃんの席替えの思い出は？】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎5回連続真ん中の1番前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教卓と自分の机がぴったーんつくくらいのとこ！さすがに飽きました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆チョタイさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁おばあちゃんの為に福祉の資格取ろうとしてるけど、自信ないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎とても素敵なことだと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫！応援しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)すごいたくさん\nみんな書いてくれてるから\nてきるだけセレクトできるように\nセレクトしてまとめるの頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/14/9727535/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月15日 発売  EX大衆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↘︎伊織と2人で取材してもらいました！\n2人では初めて！1年前に遠征先のホテルの中で2人で将来のこと話したり\n伊織が加入前の2年前の8枚目選抜発表の乃木どこ放送終わりにメールでした大事な約束のことを取材してもらって2人で話してるときに\nまた思い出しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織は特別な存在です(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月21日  発売   週刊ヤングジャンプ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↘︎ソログラビアです！！！\n2015年最後の撮影で、とても楽しくて\n心に残ってます！！！\nはやく発売されて皆さんにみてほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月30日 発売   BUBKA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↘︎みさ先輩と2人で取材してもらいました！\nバッティングセンターに行って\n打ったり応援してもらったり\n打ってるみさ先輩を見てはしゃいだり！\n取材ではみさ先輩の熱い思いや\n私たちアンダーメンバーを思ってくれてる事\nを聞けて感動しました！\n乃木坂全体の話や個人の話！\n沢山はなしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br